---
// The page rule — the vertical line descending the page, in its final drawn state.
// motion-spec.md's initial-state pattern: markup ships every SVG finished; step 09 adds
// a `drawSVG` scrub on `#rule path` on top of this, and must find the id and the path
// unchanged. Purely decorative — the real relationships (marker <-> note) already exist
// as real links in the markup, so this carries aria-hidden.
---

<svg id="rule" class="rule-svg" viewBox="0 0 1 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
  <path
    d="M0.5 0 V100"
    fill="none"
    stroke="var(--color-line)"
    stroke-width="1"
    vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"
  />
</svg>
